text":" 为 "},{"type":"text","text":"radial","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（四周展开）或 "},{"type":"text","text":"tree","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（单向展开），"},{"type":"text","text":"direction","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 为 "},{"type":"text","text":"right","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 或 "},{"type":"text","text":"left","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e0f36fbd"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"节点 ID 和名称最长 200 个字符，最多 500 个节点。重复 ID、缺失父节点、循环和多个根节点都会被拒绝。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-dff36e2a"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json","id":"node-def36c97"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"kind\": \"mindmap\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"title\": \"研究计划\",\n    \"layout\": \"radial\",\n    \"nodes\": [\n      { \"id\": \"root\", \"parentId\": null, \"label\": \"研究计划\" },\n      { \"id\": \"question\", \"parentId\": \"root\", \"label\": \"研究问题\" },\n      { \"id\": \"method\", \"parentId\": \"root\", \"label\": \"研究方法\" },\n      { \"id\": \"interview\", \"parentId\": \"method\", \"label\": \"访谈\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-db37fa33"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"交互流程图"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"适合解释流程、分支和依赖。一个流程图组件可以包含多条可切换的流程，每条流程有自己的节点和连线，方向为从上到下或从左到右。节点可以带说明、按需查询的命令和参考文档，读者点击时展开。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-da37f8a0"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"节点类型决定外观：用户意图、技能入口、条件判断、按需文档、CLI 查询、结果。每条流程最多 200 个节点、400 条连线，一个组件最多 20 条流程。嵌在页面里时默认锁定，解锁后可以缩放、平移。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-dd35bec2"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-de35c055"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"图形组件：Archify、Diagram Design、Fireworks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这三类图形组件在组件库的「流程」类目里，直接显示原项目生成的 SVG 或 HTML。内置模板是可编辑的示例，做文档时请换成自己的事实。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-db35bb9c"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"ar","label":"Archify","sub":"交互架构图","tone":"brand"},{"id":"dd","label":"Diagram Design","sub":"编辑风格图形","tone":"teal"},{"id":"fw","label":"Fireworks","sub":"技术图","tone":"warm"}],"rows":[{"label":"内置模板","values":{"ar":"5 类：工作流、架构、时序、数据流、生命周期","dd":"45 类图形","fw":"12 种技术图风格"}},{"label":"保留原版的","values":{"ar":"交互阅读器：节点查找、路径探索、视觉预设、导出","dd":"排版与 CSS","fw":"SVG 几何与语义连线"}},{"label":"修改图中文字","hint":"保持原几何；文字变长时可能需要改源码布局","values":{"ar":true,"dd":true,"fw":true}},{"label":"导入自己的 SVG / HTML","values":{"ar":true,"dd":true,"fw":true}},{"label":"下载 SVG / 完整 HTML","values":{"ar":true,"dd":true,"fw":true}},{"label":"上游协议","values":{"ar":"MIT","dd":"MIT","fw":"MIT"}}]},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-dc35bd2f"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"选中组件打开设置，可以换模板、改图中文字、导入 HTML / SVG 文件或编辑完整源码。「图形呈现」默认是简洁样式：标题和说明放在图外，补充说明隐藏；选「原版」可以恢复上游的完整图形。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d935b876"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"图形默认锁定，页面照常滚动；解锁后使用图形内部的探索和缩放。阅读时的选择不会改写保存的源码。导入的图形请内嵌字体、图片和图标，阅读器的隔离框架不允许外部请求。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-da35ba09"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-d735b550"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"其他内置组件"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🔢","title":"关键指标","body":"有来源的数值、单位、变化和说明。本页开头那一行就是它。"},{"icon":"🗃️","title":"数据库","body":"可搜索、筛选、排序，在表格和看板间切换，下载 CSV。"},{"icon":"🎚️","title":"交互计算","body":"用滑块探索求和、乘积或平均值，最多 30 个输入。"},{"icon":"🧮","title":"对比矩阵","body":"按维度逐行对比多个方案，可突出自己的方案、只看差异。"},{"icon":"🌳","title":"状态树","body":"区分走通、没走通、进行中、待探索与搁置，点击看依据。"},{"icon":"📕","title":"PDF 文档","body":"内置阅读器：翻页、缩放、初始页码和下载。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-d835b6e3"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"此外还有早期的数据图表（折线、柱状）、图片画廊、视频与音频、参考文献、来源书签、证据探索、机制分镜和实验追踪。视频、音频等本地文件单个最多 64 MiB。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e535cb5a"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每个组件的参数、示例和使用说明都在组件库详情里，Agent 通过同一个目录查询。离线导出时，图片要内嵌到页面中，详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"导出与分享","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e635cced"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ef3c96dd"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🧱","title":"组件与模板","body":"查找、插入组件，作用域与版本。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"},{"icon":"📤","title":"导出与分享","body":"导出后哪些交互还能用。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"},{"icon":"📄","title":"页面文件格式","body":"内置组件的数据契约。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-ee3c954a"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-9d6e05b3","vis-metrics","node-9f6e08d9","node-9e6e0746","vis-choose","node-a06e0a6c","node-a36e0f25","vis-g2-area","vis-g2-donut","vis-g2-sankey","node-51306530","node-523066c3","node-53306856","node-543069e9","node-55306b7c","node-56306d0f","node-57306ea2","node-58307035","node-593071c8","node-5a30735b","node-e33806cb","node-e2380538","node-e53809f1","vis-mindmap","node-e7380d17","node-e6380b84","node-e938103d","node-e8380eaa","node-db37fa33","node-da37f8a0","node-dd35bec2","node-de35c055","node-db35bb9c","node-dc35bd2f","node-d935b876","node-da35ba09","node-d735b550","node-d835b6e3","node-e535cb5a","node-e635cced","node-ef3c96dd","node-ee3c954a"]}},"comments":[]}